          "alt": null
        },
        "highlights": "<h2 id=\"\">Latest Updates....</h2><p id=\"\"><br><br>All PorchFest performances are FREE, with tips for the musicians suggested. The 2pm band is for people who purchased VIP tickets only. From 7-8 pm, four downtown venues will feature spotlight musicians. &nbsp;The event closes with a concert from 8-10 at the South end of Main Street. &nbsp;The full schedule of performance is available in our<a id=\"\" href=\"https://www.enjoysenoia.com/event-logistics/senoia-porchfest-2025#lineup\"> line-up</a>.</p><p>‍</p><p>Artist Alley vendors are located on Pylant Street between Travis and Seavy Streets, <a id=\"\" href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/dZiEogCFcGN1UMVb9\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a> for a map/directions.</p><p id=\"\">‍</p><p id=\"\">Food Trucks are located on Gin Street just to the East of Intersection of Gin Street and Lower Creek Trail, <a id=\"\" href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/pgaZTJoCBJugmrRM9\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a> for a map/directions.</p><p id=\"\">‍</p><p id=\"\">Handicap Parking is at the US Post Office Parking lot - <a id=\"\" rel=\"handicap parking\" href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Jee49Fk7CWhZVd1r7\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a> for a map/directions.</p><p id=\"\">‍</p><p id=\"\">Restrooms/Portajohns are located on Gin Street just past the food trucks, on Pylant St. near the intersection of Travis Street, at the intersection of Pylant and Morgan Street, at the intersection of Lower Creek Trail and McKnight Drive, intersection of Travis Street and Baggarly Way, intersection of Seavy Street and Baggarly Way, intersection of Seavy Street and Barnes Street, and behind City Hall.‍ </p><p id=\"\">‍</p><p id=\"\">NEED HELP - Please stop by the Merchandise &amp; Information booth on Pylant Street or on Main Street.</p><p id=\"\">‍</p>",
        "highlight-background-color": "hsla(213.8961038961039, 90.67%, 66.61%, 1.00)",
