        "highlights": "<h2 id=\"\">Latest Updates....</h2><p id=\"\"><br><br>All PorchFest performances from 3 - 6 PM are FREE, with tips for the musicians suggested. You can click on the band name in the <a id=\"\" href=\"/event-logistics/senoia-porchfest-2023#lineup\">line-up</a> to see more info about each band and to leave a tip! The full schedule of performance is available in our <a id=\"\" href=\"/event-logistics/senoia-porchfest-2023#lineup\">line-up</a>.<br><br><strong id=\"\">Twilight Tunes</strong><br><br>If you haven't already purchased your ticket for tonight’s Twilight Tunes concert, you can still do so at the Merchandise Booth . &nbsp;<br><br><strong id=\"\">Artist Alley</strong> vendors are located on Pylant Street between Travis and Seavy Streets, <a id=\"\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/wkq2w5HAnTEvqeiz5\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a> for a map/directions.<br><br><strong id=\"\">Food Trucks</strong> are located on Gin Street just to the East of Intersection of Gin Street and Lower Creek Trail, <a id=\"\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/HrB7anCj8eejLCUF8\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a> for a map/directions.<br><br><strong id=\"\">Handicap Parking</strong> is at the US&nbsp;Post Office Parking lot - <a id=\"\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/oQryxwMaZzLmm2iw8\">click here</a> for a map/directions.<br><br><strong id=\"\">Restrooms/Portajohns</strong> are located on <a id=\"\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/oQryxwMaZzLmm2iw8\" target=\"_blank\">Gin Street just past the food trucks</a>, on <a id=\"\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/X8MTdXKvgdPP7j917\" target=\"_blank\">Pylant St. near the intersection of Seavy St</a>., at the intersection of <a id=\"\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/oQryxwMaZzLmm2iw8\" target=\"_blank\">Pylant and Morgan Streets</a>, and <a id=\"\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/X8MTdXKvgdPP7j917\" target=\"_blank\">behind City Hall</a>.‍<strong id=\"\">NEED&nbsp;HELP - Having trouble with VIP&nbsp;ticket purchases, please stop by the Merchandise &amp;&nbsp;Information booth.</strong></p>",
