        "map-pdf": {
          "fileId": "64f0aa83e337c9daedde2a5e",
          "url": "https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62c89378d6e1292fdfcdd98a/64f0aa83e337c9daedde2a5e_2023-PorchFest-Map_FINAL.pdf",
          "alt": null
        },
        "highlights": "<h2 id=\"\">Latest Updates....</h2><p id=\"\"><br><br>All PorchFest performances from 3 - 6 PM are FREE, with tips for the musicians suggested. You can click on the band name in the <a id=\"\" href=\"/event-logistics/senoia-porchfest-2023#lineup\">line-up</a> to see more info about each band and to leave a tip! The full schedule of performance is available in our <a id=\"\" href=\"/event-logistics/senoia-porchfest-2023#lineup\">line-up</a>.<br><br><strong id=\"\">VIP&nbsp;Concert</strong><br><br>If you haven't already purchased your VIP ticket for tonight’s VIP concert, you can still do so at <a id=\"\" href=\"#vip\">here</a> . &nbsp;Your $10 ticket gets you into the VIP area, access to the VIP food and beverage vendors and a great concert with Cowboy Noyz as warm-up and FLUX - who will have us dancing the night away. Once you’ve purchased your VIP tickets or if you need to pay with cash, stop by the information booth and pick up your VIP area wristbands at any time up until show time. <br><br><strong>Artist Alley</strong> vendors are located on Pylant Street between Travis and Seavy Streets, <a id=\"\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/wkq2w5HAnTEvqeiz5\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a> for a map/directions.<br><br><strong>Food Trucks</strong> are located on Gin Street just to the East of Intersection of Gin Street and Lower Creek Trail, <a id=\"\" href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/HrB7anCj8eejLCUF8\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a> for a map/directions.<a id=\"\"><br><br></a><a id=\"\" href=\"#details\">More info</a> on Food Trucks and Artist Alley.<br><br><strong>Handicap Parking</strong> is at the US&nbsp;Post Office Parking lot - <a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/oQryxwMaZzLmm2iw8\">click here</a> for a map/directions.<br><br><strong>Restrooms/Portajohns</strong> are located on <a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/oQryxwMaZzLmm2iw8\" target=\"_blank\">Gin Street just past the food trucks</a>, on <a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/X8MTdXKvgdPP7j917\" target=\"_blank\">Pylant St. near the intersection of Seavy St</a>., at the intersection of <a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/oQryxwMaZzLmm2iw8\" target=\"_blank\">Pylant and Morgan Streets</a>, and <a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/X8MTdXKvgdPP7j917\" target=\"_blank\">behind City Hall</a>.<strong id=\"\"><br><br>Remember to text \"JOIN\" to 18336785617 to receive official PorchFest text notifications. We won't spam you or share your info with anyone else and we won't text you after the event. You can unsubscribe at any time by responding \"STOP\" to any text we send to you.</strong></p><p id=\"\">‍</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">NEED&nbsp;HELP - Having trouble with VIP&nbsp;ticket purchases, please stop by the information booth on the day of PorchFest or email </strong><a id=\"\" href=\"mailto:webmaster@enjoysenoia.com\"><strong id=\"\">webmaster@enjoysenoia.com</strong></a><strong id=\"\">.</strong></p><p id=\"\">‍</p>",
